{"2760570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pure Hearts", "steam_appid": 2760570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/9c7a23dbc33fb088279b44a54e8b5c3c.avif?t=1780334549\" width=617 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Hearts is a social sandbox MMORPG where every player becomes part of a living world. Choose your own path, help develop your city, master a profession, and shape the fate of the entire Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/5cf1439760ee7b3a3337de0aa93fcdde.poster.avif?t=1780334549\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/5cf1439760ee7b3a3337de0aa93fcdde.webm?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/5cf1439760ee7b3a3337de0aa93fcdde.mp4?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Become a blacksmith, merchant, farmer, hunter, or warrior. Improve your crafting abilities or strengthen your combat skills. Your actions determine your opportunities, social status, personal needs, and contribution to the prosperity of your city. Explore a vast open world filled with opportunities for discovery and growth. Mine valuable resources, hunt wild animals in dense forests, cultivate fertile lands, and venture into dungeons with unique rewards. Complete tasks from citizens through the city board, earn your first coins, and gather rare materials for crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/2102bcbde4b40ac20038f81b053324ba.poster.avif?t=1780334549\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/2102bcbde4b40ac20038f81b053324ba.webm?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/2102bcbde4b40ac20038f81b053324ba.mp4?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each city has its own hierarchy and social roles. Find your place in society and become an important part of the economy and everyday life of the settlement. Trade goods, supply food to citizens, craft equipment, or defend your city from enemy attacks. Social interaction and cooperation between players are at the heart of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/918d775bb8a061918c5dbeb39406a51c.poster.avif?t=1780334549\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/918d775bb8a061918c5dbeb39406a51c.webm?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/918d775bb8a061918c5dbeb39406a51c.mp4?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The intuitive interface makes the world easy to learn even for new players, while basic resources remain valuable throughout the entire game. This allows newcomers to compete on the market even after the season has already begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/7d594edd4237dc9d4841f048ec5a2091.poster.avif?t=1780334549\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/7d594edd4237dc9d4841f048ec5a2091.webm?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/7d594edd4237dc9d4841f048ec5a2091.mp4?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every few months, a new season begins on the servers. Players adapt to balance changes, rebuild cities, and develop fresh economies. At the end of each season, large scale wars for power begin. Cities prepare for sieges, conquer neighboring territories, and fight for domination over the entire map. Victory belongs to the Kingdom that succeeds in taking control of the whole world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/951ded5ed9fe6345af99806ce86565d1.avif?t=1780334549\" width=617 height=177 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/9c7a23dbc33fb088279b44a54e8b5c3c.avif?t=1780334549\" width=617 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Hearts is a social sandbox MMORPG where every player becomes part of a living world. Choose your own path, help develop your city, master a profession, and shape the fate of the entire Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/5cf1439760ee7b3a3337de0aa93fcdde.poster.avif?t=1780334549\" width=1138 height=640 ><sourc