_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/918d775bb8a061918c5dbeb39406a51c.poster.avif?t=1780334549\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/918d775bb8a061918c5dbeb39406a51c.webm?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/918d775bb8a061918c5dbeb39406a51c.mp4?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The intuitive interface makes the world easy to learn even for new players, while basic resources remain valuable throughout the entire game. This allows newcomers to compete on the market even after the season has already begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/7d594edd4237dc9d4841f048ec5a2091.poster.avif?t=1780334549\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/7d594edd4237dc9d4841f048ec5a2091.webm?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760570/extras/7d594edd4237dc9d4841f048ec5a2091.mp4?t=1780334549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every few months, a new season begins on the servers. Players adapt to balance changes, rebuild cities, and develop fresh economies. At the end of each season, large scale wars for power begin. Cities prepare for sieges, conquer neighboring territories, and fight for domination over the entire map. Victory belongs to the Kingdom that succeeds in taking control of the whole world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class